The new trophy code is finished; on thinking about it, we decided that
rather than adding these as new Major Trophies, we'll add a new category
called Theme Trophies and start it out with these two.

Basically, I didn't like the names but want to keep the  Most *
Ascension naming convention on Major Trophies.  ;-)

These two are now called "Basic Extinct" and "Who Wants To Be A
Killionaire?"  (Thanks to #devnull_nethack and #nethack for all the
suggestions.)

-robin

